@startuml
[*] --> LoggedOut
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : Register
LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : Login

LoggedIn --> TeacherRole : ChooseTeacher
LoggedIn --> StudentRole : ChooseStudent

TeacherRole --> QuizCreation : CreateQuiz
TeacherRole --> QuizEditing : EditQuiz
TeacherRole --> QuizSaving : SaveQuiz
QuizSaving --> Draft : SaveAsDraft
QuizSaving --> Posted : PostQuiz
Posted --> QuizResults : QuizOver

QuizEditing --> QuizCreation : SaveChanges
QuizCreation --> QuizSaving : Save

StudentRole --> QuizSelection : GetNotified
QuizSelection --> QuizAnswering : SelectQuiz
QuizAnswering --> QuizSubmitting : AnswerQuiz
QuizSubmitting --> QuizResultViewing : SubmitQuiz
QuizResultViewing --> StudentRole : ViewResult

QuizResults --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizResultViewing --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizSaving --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizEditing --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizCreation --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizSelection --> LoggedIn : Logout
QuizAnswering --> LoggedIn : Logout
TeacherRole --> LoggedOut : Logout
StudentRole --> LoggedOut : Logout

[*] --> FinalState
@enduml
